{"text": "En el puerto, Pinocho vio la barca de Gepeto junto a un muelle. El viento la había alejado y una cuerda estaba enredada. Con ayuda de una pescadora, Pinocho lanzó una soga y la sujetó al muelle. Pescadora: Tira conmigo cuando te avise.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.315833, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.330583, "end": 0.478249, "from": 3, "to": 5}, {"start": 0.493041, "end": 0.995166, "from": 6, "to": 12}, {"start": 1.349625, "end": 1.85175, "from": 14, "to": 21}, {"start": 1.8665, "end": 2.088041, "from": 22, "to": 25}, {"start": 2.102791, "end": 2.206166, "from": 26, "to": 28}, {"start": 2.220958, "end": 2.590166, "from": 29, "to": 34}, {"start": 2.604958, "end": 2.723124, "from": 35, "to": 37}, {"start": 2.737875, "end": 3.284291, "from": 38, "to": 44}, {"start": 3.299041, "end": 3.638707, "from": 45, "to": 50}, {"start": 3.6535, "end": 3.683041, "from": 51, "to": 52}, {"start": 3.697791, "end": 3.874999, "from": 53, "to": 55}, {"start": 3.889791, "end": 4.391916, "from": 56, "to": 62}, {"start": 5.42, "end": 5.656291, "from": 64, "to": 66}, {"start": 5.671083, "end": 6.055083, "from": 67, "to": 73}, {"start": 6.069833, "end": 6.187999, "from": 74, "to": 76}, {"start": 6.20275, "end": 6.483333, "from": 77, "to": 82}, {"start": 6.498125, "end": 7.118416, "from": 83, "to": 90}, {"start": 7.133166, "end": 7.266082, "from": 91, "to": 92}, {"start": 7.280833, "end": 7.502374, "from": 93, "to": 96}, {"start": 7.517125, "end": 7.930625, "from": 97, "to": 103}, {"start": 7.945416, "end": 8.358916, "from": 104, "to": 110}, {"start": 8.373708, "end": 9.038291, "from": 111, "to": 119}, {"start": 10.057291, "end": 10.278832, "from": 121, "to": 124}, {"start": 10.293583, "end": 10.662791, "from": 125, "to": 130}, {"start": 10.677583, "end": 10.810499, "from": 131, "to": 133}, {"start": 10.82525, "end": 11.076333, "from": 134, "to": 137}, {"start": 11.091083, "end": 11.785208, "from": 138, "to": 147}, {"start": 12.154416, "end": 12.671291, "from": 149, "